{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123746","id":4610790068,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEtMStA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123746","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123746.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123746.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123746","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123746/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123746/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123746/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/128a9e70f5b0229a3cdfdda43612b9a332a0ff02","number":123746,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix Viewport texture filter inheritance","user":{"login":"fsfgrafb","id":86371613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MzcxNjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86371613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb","html_url":"https://github.com/fsfgrafb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n* Related to #119462.\r\n* A Viewport inheriting its default texture filter can incorrectly fall back to linear filtering when the parent `CanvasItem` resolves to the viewport default, or when an ordinary `Node` sits between it and the enclosing Viewport.\r\n* Filter changes can also stop at intermediate nodes, leaving inheriting Viewports with a stale renderer-side value.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis changes the inheritance lookup so it can fall back to the nearest enclosing Viewport when needed, while still respecting explicit `CanvasItem` filters and explicit Viewport filters.\r\n\r\nFilter-change propagation now also crosses intermediate nodes.\r\n\r\nThe default texture filter of `Window` and `SubViewport` is unchanged; this only affects Viewports configured to inherit their filter.\r\n\r\nI also added regression tests for nested Viewports, intermediate nodes, explicit overrides, reparenting, and Window/Popup cases. The existing Viewport tests pass with the fix.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","